Adaptive Media 0.3.2 development build trigger

Scope:
- ESC must leave fullscreen without quitting playback
- Gentle/Smooth motion use Vulkan FIFO only when the completed launch plan remains Vulkan
- Compatibility and RTX VPP D3D11 plans must not receive the Vulkan FIFO option
- RTX VSR/HDR D3D11 VPP must override both gpu-api and gpu-context together
- diagnostics capture mpv UTF-8 output without PowerShell 5.1 console mojibake
- diagnostics report the actual managed NVIDIA/Compatibility/RTX renderer policy
- diagnostics label multi-adapter / NVIDIA+Intel topology as an informational hint only
- 0.3.1 remains the frozen friend-test release

Dev4 validation target:
- preserve all green dev3 playback, renderer, RTX, fullscreen, diagnostics, and deterministic integration semantics
- hardware certification script must pass its standalone Windows PowerShell 5.1 self-test before build
- bundle that exact reviewed PS1/CMD into the private installer without source drift
- isolated installer smoke must prove the certification files are installed and the installed PS1 self-test passes
- interactive installer completion page defaults to objective hardware certification; normal app launch remains optional
- silent CI installs must skip all postinstall UI actions
- final deliverable for this stage is one private installer EXE, not an Actions ZIP/manual extraction workflow
- no public tag or release
